{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1482184-d-tf-uses-for-lore-of-light-5","id":1482184,"title":"D:tF - Uses for Lore of Light 5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-28T11:53:54-07:00","id":1482184,"title":"D:tF - Uses for Lore of Light 5","content":"The 5th level of the Lore of Light first seemed useless to me, but after watching Tron, where everything seems to be made of light, I have had some second thoughts. How far do you think you can abuse the 5th level of Lore of Light? You can use it to create a person or a dog, but what about a boat, with a conjured Orca to push it, a getaway car, a small plane or so on. I know the illusion is supposed to be fragile, but within limits, maybe you can use it like a Green Lantern.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-29T08:33:00-07:00","id":1482252,"title":"","content":"Huh, Lore of Light 5 always seemed like one of the Most abusable and broken lores to me when I first read it.<br /> <br /> Think about it, the power creates solid illusions with their Own Dice Pools and all it's dice pools come from a single Attribute + Ability combo by the caster. This means it's trivially easy to give the the fiend 10 dice for the initial roll and use difficulty reducers to transfer most of the dice, which could easily give you a construct with 6-8 dice on everything, <i>Including abilities your character doesn't have</i>.<br /> <br /> A fiend can essentially create illusionary firearms or explosives experts, disposable trap-finders, athletes, etc. As an ST, I wouldn't allow the construct to have things like knowledges the character doesn't have, but the power doesn't actually say that. If a person can imagine a someone or something that can do the action they want, they can make an illusion capable of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-29T10:51:13-07:00","id":1482271,"title":"","content":"Sure, but I always felt that you having to keep your eyes on them the whole time was a bit painful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-29T21:14:52-07:00","id":1482339,"title":"","content":"The only thing between it and being a Green Lantern is precisely the illusions fragility, if the ST doesn't let you use other Lores to affect it or use it in a ritual for a more potent construct.<br /> <br /> With all its versatility, line of sight isn't a big deal because you have access to any tool you can imagine, paying attention to it is what barely keeps it from becoming completely broken.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T13:24:17-07:00","id":1482399,"title":"","content":"Ok, I guess I just misinterpreted that piece.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}